#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGOLAND: unflagged cold boot through `D:\lmi.avi` (skipped via
# `LeftControl+Q`) -> `D:\Intro.avi` (`IV50` + `0x0011` IMA ADPCM audio,
# skipped via `Space`) -> `Player Details` -> create profile "ADA" ->
# `Accept` -> rendered `Title Screen` -> `Exit Game` -> `Yes` -> clean exit 0
# (#394, #395).
#
# Sequence:
# - Flips 0..6: `D:\lmi.avi` plays (`IV50` + 8-bit PCM); `LeftControl+Q` skips.
# - Flips 7..35: `D:\Intro.avi` plays (`IV50` + `0x0011` IMA ADPCM stereo via
#   MSACM32); `Space` skips cleanly to `Player Details`.
# - Flips 38..49: `Player Details` renders with `Lego.TTF` GDI text, animated
#   `AD_Blink.avi` advisor orb, and `rab over icon.lls` cursor at (320, 240).
# - Flips 50..56: move to profile slot 1 (260, 187) and click to activate entry.
# - Flips 62..76: type "ADA" and confirm with Return (`profiles\Profile1.txt`).
# - Flips 90..96: move to `Accept` (562, 402) and click to enter `Title Screen`.
# - Flips 97..119: animated 640x480x16 `Title Screen` with `Start Game` unlocked.
# - Flips 120..126: click `Exit Game` (557, 93) to open `EXIT / Are you sure?`.
# - Flips 136..142: click green checkmark (395, 173) -> clean `ExitProcess(0)`.
flip 4 key LeftControl down
flip 5 key Q down
flip 6 key Q up
flip 7 key LeftControl up
flip 35 key Space down
flip 37 key Space up
flip 50 move 260 187
flip 54 down left
flip 56 up left
flip 62 key LeftShift down
flip 63 key A down
flip 64 key A up
flip 65 key D down
flip 66 key D up
flip 67 key A down
flip 68 key A up
flip 69 key LeftShift up
flip 74 key Return down
flip 76 key Return up
flip 90 move 562 402
flip 94 down left
flip 96 up left
flip 120 move 557 93
flip 124 down left
flip 126 up left
flip 136 move 395 173
flip 140 down left
flip 142 up left
